# Marketing

- Channels / cadence / Day-15 ads verdict: `docs/marketing/PLAN.md`
- App backlog / status / measure checklist: `docs/marketing/PRODUCT.md`

Update those files when strategy or product status changes; do not invent a new acquisition strategy in chat.

## Channels (current window)

1. **Search ads** — Japan search only, ¥500–800/day, 14 days then hard stop. Exact keywords in PLAN. No display/YouTube. Ads OFF until PRODUCT P0 checklist is done.
2. **X** — Keep glossary cards (`content/x/`). Trust/education; one-line CTA max.
3. **Reddit** — 2–3 comments/week. No SiteKPI/OKPy/blog links. No new posts until the account is trusted. Comments only for name-building.

## Product changes

- Prefer edits listed in PRODUCT.md (landing/connect copy, funnel leak fixes).
- One funnel fix at a time during the ads window (P1-1).
- Production demo = `/samples`, not `/connect/demo`.

## Do not

- Pitch product on Reddit in this window
- Add channels (Discord, more social) without editing PLAN first
- Treat content volume as the user-growth engine; ads = intent test, X/Reddit = trust
- Extend ads past day 15 without the Day-15 verdict table in PLAN

## Agent output

- Reddit: copy-paste EN comments, no links
- X: drafts under `content/x/` per existing README
- Ads: copy/keywords only; no fake “users will scale” promises
- After shipping product work: set status + date in PRODUCT.md Log/Status
